                    <span class="parallax-quote">"</span>
                    <h2 class="founder-title">Why I built Gatekeeper.</h2>
                    <div class="founder-content">
                        <p>"I spent three years making 60 calls a day. Most people didn't even remember asking for help.
                            I realized the problem wasn't what I was saying. <strong>It was who I was talking
                                to.</strong>"</p>
                        <p>Most agencies give you more leads because that's easy. We give you better leads because
                            that's what actually makes you money. I built Gatekeeper to save your time the same way I
                            wish someone had saved mine.</p>
